  {
    "speaker": "司会者",
    "text": "さてと、ここからは色々とお話を聞いていこうかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "司会者",
    "text": "あさひちゃんは、面白いことが大好きなんだって？\r\n最近はどんな面白いことがあったかな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 4001082040120,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "この前、みんなですごいパーティーに行ったっすよ\r\n会場がキラキラで、初めての料理ばっかりだったっす",
    "charAnim1": "surp4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400108204/4001082040120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "司会者",
    "text": "そうなの！\r\n一番美味しかった料理はなんだったかな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001082040130,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "うーん、白くてふわふわだったやつっすね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400108204/4001082040130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "司会者",
    "text": "白くてふわふわ……。あー、これはあれだね\r\n名前が難しい料理で、覚えてないパターンだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001082040140,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "あはは、そっすね！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400108204/4001082040140"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001082040150,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "名前、聞いたっすけど……\r\n冬優子ちゃんも愛依ちゃんもわからなかったみたいっす",
    "charAnim1": "why",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400108204/4001082040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "司会者",
    "text": "わかるわかる\r\n私も小難しいの覚えられない人だから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0220",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1300
  },
  {
    "speaker": "司会者",
    "text": "それじゃ、次のお話なんだけど\r\nあ、これもまた料理のお話だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "司会者",
    "text": "お勧めの食べ物はあるかな？\r\nさっきの、ふわふわ以外で",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001082040160,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "愛依ちゃんがたまに作ってくるお菓子っすね",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400108204/4001082040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "司会者",
    "text": "いいねぇ、メンバーからの差し入れ\r\n最近だと、どんなお菓子だった？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001082040170,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "チョコケーキっす",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400108204/4001082040170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "司会者",
    "text": "美味しいんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001082040180,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "そっすね。どんどん上手になってる気がするっす",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400108204/4001082040180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "司会者",
    "text": "そうなんだ、そういう一面も……\r\nあ、これギャップってやつだ、いいね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "司会者",
    "text": "でも、そんなに美味しいなら\r\n気になっちゃうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001082040190,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "今度、持ってきてもらえばいっすよ",
    "charAnim1": "think1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400108204/4001082040190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "司会者",
    "text": "ふふっ、じゃあ次は愛依ちゃんにも\r\n出演してもらわないとね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
